                  2 · SaaS Suite v0.12.1 · Finale Startlöcher
                </span>
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-meg-text-primary-dark mb-3">
                Waldheim Suite – 8 Module, 1 Login
              </h3>
              <p class="text-meg-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">
                Mit <strong>v0.12.1 in den finalen Startlöchern</strong> vor v1.0 und <strong>ab sofort produktiv nutzbar</strong>: Steuern Sie CRM (Socialverse), ERP (Silvacore), DMS (Aether), Fuhrpark (Ecodrive), Finanzen (Treasury), Immobilien (Properties), Messaging (Relay) und Workflows (Conductor) aus einer mandantenisolierten App-Shell.
              </p>
              <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-meg-text-secondary mb-8">
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-emerald-400" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>XRechnung 3.0 &amp; ZUGFeRD PDF/A-3b, DATEV EXTF 700 &amp; CAMT.053</span></li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-emerald-400" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Smart Masks, Server-Driven DataTables &amp; WEG-Zählerkaskade</span></li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-emerald-400" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>100% DSGVO-konform (PostgreSQL RLS) · Live-Demo sofort startklar</span></li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 pt-4 border-t border-meg-border-dark/60">
              <TrackedButton
                href="/suite/"
                trackEvent="cta_homepage_suite_overview"
                trackCategory="suite_launch"
                trackLabel="Suite Overview"
                variant="primary"
                icon="fa-solid fa-layer-group"
                iconPosition="left"
              >
                Suite entdecken
              </TrackedButton>
              <TrackedButton
                href="https://suite.waldheim.dev"
                trackEvent="cta_homepage_suite_live"
                trackCategory="suite_launch"
                trackLabel="Suite Live Demo"
                variant="secondary"
                icon="fa-solid fa-arrow-up-right-from-square"
              >
                Jetzt live nutzen
              </TrackedButton>
            </div>
          </article>

          <!-- Anker 3: Open Source Stack & semrel -->
          <article class="bg-meg-surface-dark/50 border border-meg-border-dark hover:border-blue-500/50 rounded-3xl p-8 flex flex-col justify-between transition-all duration-300 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl">
            <div>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
                <div class="size-12 rounded-2xl bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-blue-400">
                  <i class="fa-solid fa-code-branch text-xl" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                </div>
                <span class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-blue-400 bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-500/20 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">
                  3 · Open Source · semrel v0.28.3
                </span>
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-meg-text-primary-dark mb-3">
                semrel &amp; Open-Source Ökosystem
              </h3>
              <p class="text-meg-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">
                Produktionsreife Open-Source-Software als gelebter Beweis für Engineering-Exzellenz: allen voran <strong>semrel v0.28.3</strong> (im letzten Feinschliff vor dem v1.0 Release) – die Go-native, zero-dependency Semantic-Release-Engine für Monorepos, Enterprise-CI/CD und Air-Gap-Umgebungen.
              </p>
              <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-meg-text-secondary mb-8">
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-emerald-400" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Statisches Go-Binary ohne Node.js-Abhängigkeiten</span></li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-emerald-400" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Cosign v3 Bundle, CycloneDX/SPDX SBOM &amp; SLSA</span></li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-emerald-400" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Workspace 2.0 (Shared/Ignore Paths, Paket-Changelogs) &amp; 46 Plugins</span></li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 pt-4 border-t border-meg-border-dark/60">
              <TrackedButton
                href="/semrel/"
                trackEvent="cta_homepage_anchor_semrel"
                trackCategory="strategic_anchors"
                trackLabel="semrel Overview"
                variant="primary"
                icon="fa-solid fa-code-branch"
                iconPosition="left"
              >
                semrel v0.28.3
              </TrackedButton>
              <TrackedButton
                href="#opensource-stack"
                trackEvent="cta_homepage_anchor_oss"
                trackCategory="strategic_anchors"
                trackLabel="Open Source Stack"
                variant="secondary"
                icon="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"
              >
                Alle OSS-Tools
              </TrackedButton>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section
      class="bento-service relative isolate py-24"
      aria-labelledby="services-heading"
    >
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 lg:px-8">
        <h2 id="services-heading" class="sr-only">
          Meine IT-Services und Prinzipien
        </h2>
        <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-6 grid-cols-1 gap-6">
          <!-- Core Principles Card (Engineering Excellence) -->
          <article
            class="bento-card lg:col-span-3 lg:row-span-2 bg-meg-surface-dark/40 backdrop-blur-xl border border-meg-border-dark rounded-3xl p-10 flex flex-col justify-between group hover:border-meg-accent/50 transition-all duration-500"
          >
            <div>
              <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl mb-6">
                Maximale Qualität durch <span
                  class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-meg-accent to-sky-400"
                  >Engineering Excellence</span
                >
              </h2>
              <p class="text-lg text-meg-text-secondary mb-8">
                IT ist kein Selbstzweck, sondern Ihr stärkster Hebel. Ich
                garantiere Lösungen, die nicht nur funktionieren, sondern Ihr
                Business skalierbar machen.
              </p>
              <dl class="space-y-6">
                <div>
                  <dt
                    class="flex items-center gap-3 text-meg-text-primary-dark font-bold"
                  >
                    <i
                      class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved text-meg-accent"
                      aria-hidden="true"></i> Sicherheit (By Design)
                  </dt>
                  <dd class="mt-2 ml-8 text-meg-text-secondary">
                    Präventive Absicherung Ihrer Infrastruktur ab der ersten
                    Codezeile.
                  </dd>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <dt
                    class="flex items-center gap-3 text-meg-text-primary-dark font-bold"
                  >
                    <i
                      class="fa-solid fa-gauge-high text-meg-accent"
                      aria-hidden="true"></i> High Performance
                  </dt>
                  <dd class="mt-2 ml-8 text-meg-text-secondary">
                    Ladezeiten unter 1s und optimierte Core Web Vitals für beste
                    UX und SEO.
                  </dd>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <dt
                    class="flex items-center gap-3 text-meg-text-primary-dark font-bold"
                  >
                    <i
                      class="fa-solid fa-code-branch text-meg-accent"
                      aria-hidden="true"></i> Saubere Dokumentation
                  </dt>
                  <dd class="mt-2 ml-8 text-meg-text-secondary">
                    100% nachvollziehbarer Code und Architekturentscheidungen
                    (ADR).
                  </dd>
                </div>
              </dl>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-12">
              <Image
                src="/bento/cert.webp"
                alt="Zertifizierte IT-Qualität durch Markus Waldheim"
                class="rounded-2xl shadow-2xl group-hover:scale-[1.02] transition-transform duration-500"
                width={600}
                height={546}
                loading="eager"
              />
            </div>
          </article>

          <!-- Service Card: DevSecOps -->
          <article
            class="bento-card lg:col-span-3 bg-meg-surface-dark/60 backdrop-blur-xl border border-meg-border-dark rounded-3xl p-8 hover:border-violet-500/50 transition-all group"
          >
            <header>
              <h3
                class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-violet-400 to-fuchsia-500"
              >
                DevSecOps, FinOps &amp; AIOps
              </h3>
            </header>
            <p class="text-meg-text-secondary mb-6">
              Sichere CI/CD-Pipelines, GitOps, Cloud-Kostenoptimierung (FinOps),
              KI-gestützte Observability (AIOps) und Team-Coaching für eigene AI-Review- &amp; Skill-Automationen.
            </p>
            <TrackedButton
              href="/services/devsecops/"
              variant="ghost"
              icon="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"
              class="group-hover:text-violet-400"
              trackEvent="cta_service_devsecops"
              trackCategory="service_card"
              trackLabel="DevSecOps Details"
            >
              Operations skalieren
            </TrackedButton>
            <figure
              class="relative mt-8 rounded-xl overflow-hidden transition-all duration-700"
            >
              <video
                data-src="/videos/video_devsecops.mp4"
                data-poster="/videos/video_devsecops-poster.webp"
                preload="none"
                loop
                muted
                playsinline
                class="lazy-video w-full aspect-video object-cover"
                aria-label="Visualisierung einer automatisierten DevSecOps Pipeline"
              ></video>
              <AiImageBadge class="absolute bottom-2.5 right-2.5 z-10" />
            </figure>
          </article>

          <!-- Service Card: Custom Software -->
          <article
            class="bento-card lg:col-span-3 bg-meg-surface-dark/60 backdrop-blur-xl border border-meg-border-dark rounded-3xl p-8 hover:border-meg-accent/50 transition-all group"
          >
            <header>
              <h3
